∀x: Posterior_Spinal_Artery(x) 
  💡(arteryOfSpinalSegment(x) ∧ vertebraLocation(x) ∈ {L5, L4, L3, L2, L1} 
    ∧ segmentPart(x) ∈ {dorsal, lateral})

∀x: on-line algorithm(x) ↔ (∀y: input(x) ∈ I ∧ finite(x) ∧ solution(x) ∈ S ∧ correctness(x) ∧ complexity(x) ≤ c), where:

I = {x | ∀y: input(y) ∈ X and x is a possible output of y}
s = {x | ∀y: input(y) ∈ X and x is a solution to y}
correctness(x) = ∀y: input(y) ∈ I and x ∈ I and x = solution(y)
c = complexity function (e.g., time, space complexity)
